From: Alfonso Fortunato <57877156+devopsfortunato@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 20:15:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] RecoverSSM for Qwen GDN and the PLE short conv (vLLM
 #58863)

Upstream PR vllm-project/vllm#58863 (open), applied with git apply --3way on top of the series.
Drafts verify off one GDN state and the commit replays only the accepted tokens, instead of
per-draft state copies. Enabled with --use-replayssm (needs speculative decoding, the V2 model
runner and --mamba-backend triton).

Conflict resolved against v0.32.0: vllm/config/cache.py, where v0.32.0 still has
use_kda_recoverssm; the PR's rename to use_recoverssm is taken, together with its Kimi-K3 call
sites. vllm/models/kimi_k3/nvidia/specialized_decode/runtime/__init__.py does not exist in
v0.32.0 and is skipped (Kimi-K3 only).
